Niso o-> Boomlet:  <b>SetupNisoBoomletMessage4 \n boomerang_params_fingerprint_signed_by_all_peers: Collection<boomerang_params_fingerprint_signed_by_boomlet_i> \n [1 <= i <= 4]
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  setup_checkpoint := tagged_sha256("Boomerang/setup_phase_checkpoint", \n canonical_encode(setup_instance_id, "parameters_agreed", zero_bytes_32))
