Niso o-> Boomlet:  <b>SetupNisoBoomletMessage7 \n setup_checkpoint_signed_by_all_peers: Collection<setup_checkpoint_signed_by_boomlet_i> [1 <= i <= 4]
end

' Step 59
Boomlet o-> Niso:  <b>SetupBoomletNisoMessage7 \n magic: "setup_wt_service_confirmed_by_peers"

